    <title>A Novel Transformer Architecture for Efficient Language Modeling</title>
    <summary>We introduce a novel transformer architecture that achieves state-of-the-art performance on language modeling tasks while using 40% fewer parameters. Our approach combines sparse attention with adaptive computation to dynamically allocate compute per token.</summary>
